    <node id="&quot;D'ARTAGNAN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"d'Artagnan is a character in the story, known for his swashbuckling adventures and is mentioned to have a marriage with Francesca."</data>
