    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNIVERSAL PICTURES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Universal Pictures is a film production company that partnered with Miramax Films to acquire the rights to the film."</data>
